          "snippet": {
            "line": 123,
            "text": "theorem rise_at_most (hD : D.Admissible) (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b)\n    (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) {s e ulo uhi l : ℝ} (hs : a ≤ s) (he : e ≤ b)\n    (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico s e, ulo ≤ u t ∧ u t ≤ uhi) (hl : v s ≤ l) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc s e, v t ≤ l + (D.IchargeMax ulo uhi + D.eps) / D.Clo * (t - s) := by"
